Date: Fri, 3 Jul 2026 04:53:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] refactor(ui): extract shared ListPagination component

Adopts a single shared pagination footer (src/components/layout/list-pagination.tsx)
in place of three near-identical inline implementations duplicated across
Properties, Tenants, and Contracts list pages.

- Supports both existing visual variants (centered slash-style label used by
  Properties, split words-style label used by Tenants/Contracts) so no visual
  regression.
- No change to business logic, query params, or persistence -- purely a UI
  extraction of prev/next + page label markup and disabled-state logic.
- Removed now-unused Button import in ContractsListPage.

Part of the bounded Shared Components Adoption phase.
